      "items": [
        {
          "itemCode": "CAMM_01",
          "content": "我会为自己有一些说不通的情绪而生自己的气。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 0,
          "responseSetKey": "camm_freq_0_4",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "CAMM_02",
          "content": "在学校里，我从一个教室走到另一个教室，却没留意自己在做什么。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 1,
          "responseSetKey": "camm_freq_0_4",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "CAMM_03",
          "content": "我让自己忙个不停，好不去注意自己的想法或感受。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 2,
          "responseSetKey": "camm_freq_0_4",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "CAMM_04",
          "content": "我告诉自己，我不应该有现在这种感受。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 3,
          "responseSetKey": "camm_freq_0_4",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "CAMM_05",
          "content": "我把不喜欢的想法推开。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 4,
          "responseSetKey": "camm_freq_0_4",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "CAMM_06",
          "content": "我很难一次只专注于一件事。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 5,
          "responseSetKey": "camm_freq_0_4",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "CAMM_07",
          "content": "我会为自己有某些念头而生自己的气。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 6,
          "responseSetKey": "camm_freq_0_4",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "CAMM_08",
          "content": "我总想着过去发生的事，而不是留意当下正在发生的事。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 7,
          "responseSetKey": "camm_freq_0_4",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "CAMM_09",
          "content": "我觉得有些情绪是不好的，我不应该有它们。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 8,
          "responseSetKey": "camm_freq_0_4",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "CAMM_10",
          "content": "我阻止自己产生不喜欢的情绪。",
          "type": "single",
          "required": true,
          "sortOrder": 9,
          "responseSetKey": "camm_freq_0_4",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        }
      ],
